      </div>
      <div class="nav-lang"><a href="../about.html">EN</a></div>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">Music</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">为故事与玩法<br>而写的音乐。</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">原创音乐作品。</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="subworks">

      <div class="subwork" id="ciga">
        <h3>《猫锚猫》 <span class="tag">Game BGM · 2 loops</span></h3>
        <p class="desc">CiGA GameJam 的游戏背景音乐，包含基础循环与倒计时最后时刻使用的紧张循环。</p>
        <div class="videos">
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <div class="video-label">Basic Loop</div>
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/ciga-basic-loop.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <div class="video-label">Tension Loop — final countdown</div>
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/ciga-tension-loop.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subwork" id="piano">
        <h3>曲名 <span class="tag">Piano</span></h3>
        <p class="desc">钢琴声从远处传来，逐渐靠近，仿佛身处大堂之中，随后渐渐远去直至消失。通过 Reaper 中的混响等空间处理表现距离变化，适合用作主角回忆片段的配乐。</p>
        <div class="videos">
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/memory-piano.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subwork" id="powerup">
        <h3>Power Up! Game Jam <span class="tag">Game BGM · 4 pieces</span></h3>
        <p class="desc">万圣节主题游戏的音乐，按游戏流程分为日间、夜晚、昼夜转换和紧张时刻四段。</p>
        <div class="videos">
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <div class="video-label">Day</div>
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/powerup-day.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <div class="video-label">Night</div>
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/powerup-night.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <div class="video-label">Day / Night Transition</div>
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/powerup-transition.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <div class="video-label">Tension</div>
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/powerup-tension.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subwork" id="electronic">
        <h3>曲名 <span class="tag">Electronic</span></h3>
        <p class="desc">分为四段，每段的鼓点节奏都有变化，带动情绪与氛围的推进，音色组合也随之变化，结尾以机械损坏般的效果收束。</p>
        <div class="videos">
          <div class="video-wrap">
            <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%;color-scheme:dark" src="../audio/electronic-piece.mp3"></audio>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="colophon">Ember Xiong — Game Sound Designer</div></div>
</footer>

<script src="../script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
